	(text "SYSTEM NOTES\n- RMT TX carrier is runtime-selectable from 25 kHz to 50 kHz.\n- The discrete AFE rejects DC sunlight; the Schmitt stage restores logic.\n- RMT RX carrier removal yields blockage intervals for the adaptive LUT.\n- J3/J4 are joined only by the defined 600 mm harness model.\n- TP1-TP8 correlate physical nodes with transient traces."
